                                                "sense_id": "66b7c6a6-0414-30b8-a0a2-12c83146880e",
                                                "text": "Her father had long been a student of onomastics, and loved to unpack the names of people they encountered as children."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2579a443-f9aa-4c61-b630-042d0b558cf2",
                                                "sense_id": "66b7c6a6-0414-30b8-a0a2-12c83146880e",
                                                "text": "From the point of view of onomastics, proper names fulfill many functions (individualizing, localizing, differentiating etc.)."
                                            }
